# Frontend Rules - Next.js 16 & React

## 🎯 Core Principles

### React Server Components First
- **Priority**: Ưu tiên Server Components, chỉ dùng `'use client'` khi thực sự cần thiết
- **When to use 'use client'**:
  - Interactive components (onClick, onChange, useState, useEffect)
  - Browser APIs (localStorage, window, document)
  - Third-party libraries yêu cầu client-side
  - Animations với motion/react (cần browser APIs)

### Component Structure
```typescript
// ✅ Good: Server Component (default)
export default function ProductPage() {
  // Fetch data, no client-side logic
}

// ✅ Good: Client Component (when needed)
'use client'
export function ProductActions() {
  const [quantity, setQuantity] = useState(1)
  // Interactive logic
}
```

## 📁 File & Directory Conventions

### Naming
- **Files**: `kebab-case` (e.g., `product-actions.tsx`)
- **Components**: `PascalCase` (e.g., `ProductActions`)
- **Directories**: `kebab-case` (e.g., `components/shop/`)
- **Types**: `PascalCase` với suffix `Type` hoặc `Props` (e.g., `ProductType`, `ProductActionsProps`)

### Directory Structure
```
src/
├── app/              # Next.js App Router pages
│   ├── layout.tsx    # Root layout
│   ├── page.tsx      # Home page
│   └── shop/         # Shop routes
├── components/       # Reusable components
│   ├── ui/          # shadcn/ui components
│   ├── wds/         # WebDev Studios components
│   └── shop/        # E-commerce components
├── lib/             # Utilities & helpers
├── types/           # TypeScript types
└── data/            # Static data (temporary, sẽ migrate sang API)
```

## 🎨 Styling Rules

### Tailwind CSS v4
- **Approach**: Utility-first, mobile-first
- **Custom Utilities**: Sử dụng `@layer utilities` trong `globals.css`
- **Theme Colors**: Sử dụng CSS variables cho WDS colors
  ```css
  --wds-black: #000000;
  --wds-white: #ffffff;
  --wds-orange: #f7931e;
  --wds-cream: #fff8e1;
  ```

### Responsive Design
- **Breakpoints**: `sm:`, `md:`, `lg:`, `xl:`, `2xl:`
- **Mobile First**: Viết styles cho mobile trước, sau đó override cho desktop
- **Example**:
  ```tsx
  <div className="text-sm md:text-base lg:text-lg">
    Responsive text
  </div>
  ```

### Image Optimization
- **Format**: WebP (ưu tiên), fallback PNG/JPG
- **Component**: Luôn dùng Next.js `Image` component
- **Required Props**: `src`, `alt`, `width`, `height` hoặc `fill`
- **Priority**: Set `priority={true}` cho images above the fold
- **Sizes**: Luôn specify `sizes` prop cho responsive images
- **Example**:
  ```tsx
  <Image
    src="/image/hero.webp"
    alt="Hero image"
    width={1200}
    height={600}
    priority
    sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 1200px"
  />
  ```

## 🎭 Animation Rules

### motion/react Library
- **Import**: `import { motion } from 'motion/react'`
- **Performance**: Sử dụng `whileInView` cho scroll animations thay vì `useEffect`
- **Variants**: Định nghĩa animation variants để tái sử dụng
- **Example**:
  ```tsx
  const fadeInUp = {
    hidden: { opacity: 0, y: 20 },
    visible: { opacity: 1, y: 0 }
  }
  
  <motion.div
    initial="hidden"
    whileInView="visible"
    variants={fadeInUp}
    transition={{ duration: 0.5 }}
  >
    Content
  </motion.div>
  ```

## 🔄 State Management

### Server State
- **Data Fetching**: Sử dụng async Server Components
- **Caching**: Next.js built-in caching (fetch cache, route cache)
- **Example**:
  ```tsx
  export default async function ProductPage({ params }) {
    const product = await fetchProduct(params.slug)
    return <ProductDetails product={product} />
  }
  ```

### Client State
- **Simple State**: `useState` cho local component state
- **Form State**: **BẮT BUỘC** sử dụng React Hook Form 7.x.x cho tất cả forms
- **Global State**: Cân nhắc Zustand hoặc Context API (nếu thực sự cần)

### API State Management (TanStack Query) - BẮT BUỘC
- **Library**: `@tanstack/react-query` - **BẮT BUỘC** sử dụng cho tất cả API calls
- **Purpose**: Quản lý server state, caching, synchronization
- **Setup**: Wrap app với `QueryClientProvider`
- **Requirement**: 
  - **KHÔNG BAO GIỜ** gọi API trực tiếp từ component
  - **PHẢI** sử dụng TanStack Query hooks (`useQuery`, `useMutation`)
  - **PHẢI** handler `onSuccess` và `onError` trong TanStack Query mutations
  - **PHẢI** sử dụng Axios (không dùng fetch trực tiếp)
- **Example**:
  ```tsx
  // Setup QueryClient
  const queryClient = new QueryClient({
    defaultOptions: {
      queries: {
        staleTime: 60 * 1000, // 1 minute
        refetchOnWindowFocus: false,
      },
    },
  })
  
  // In app
  <QueryClientProvider client={queryClient}>
    <App />
  </QueryClientProvider>
  ```

## 🛡️ Type Safety

### TypeScript Rules
- **Strict Mode**: Luôn bật TypeScript strict mode
- **Avoid `any`**: Không dùng `any`, dùng `unknown` nếu cần
- **Type Definitions**: Định nghĩa types trong `src/types/`
- **Props Types**: Luôn type props của components
- **Example**:
  ```tsx
  interface ProductActionsProps {
    productId: string
    stock: number
    onAddToCart: (quantity: number) => void
  }
  
  export function ProductActions({ productId, stock, onAddToCart }: ProductActionsProps) {
    // ...
  }
  ```

